# Dishes
## Breakfast/Lunch
**Airmelon Porridge**
Boiled Airmelon combined with Milk and Mint.
**Lembas**
Elvish bread made with sugar and maize flour.

## Dinner
**Earthmelon Curry**
Sliced Earthmelon, Cauliflower and Lentil and a coconut milk sauce. Served with flatbread.
**Firemelon Soup**
Pureed Firemelon combined with Honey and Kashombe Pepper to form a soup.
**Watermelon Soup**
Pureed Watermelon combined with Honey.
**Watermelon Steak**
Piece of watermelon which has been seared and smoked.

# Drinks
**Pine Needle Tea**
Tea brewed from cleaned pine needles.
**Willowberry Wine (Alcoholic)**
Wine made from willowberries. After 3 a 4 glasses amplify the false confidence.
**Fruit Juices**
Can be made from: Starfruit

# Ingredients
**Watermelon Seed Oil**
Oil made from Watermelon Flower seeds. Traditionally used for cooking.

## Fruits/Vegetables
**Airmelon**
Rock hard shell with lots of juice. Grows at high altitudes.
**Earthmelon**
Softer shell with less water. Very sweet fruit inside. Grows in low rain enviroments.
**Firemelon**
Softer shell with sweet fruit and a lot of juices. Grows in hotter climates.
**Watermelon**
Soft shell with a lot of juice inside its fruit. Grows in temperate climates.
**Willowberry**
Berries which when eaten give false confidence. Only grows of WIllow trees
**Kashomba Pepper**
Pepper which grows in tropical areas.
**[[bellfruit|Bellfruit]]**
[https://i.redd.it/aw7ig1np43e41.png](https://i.redd.it/aw7ig1np43e41.png)
Sweet pearlike fruit. Like peaches, Wild Bellfruit are a sweeter variety.
**Starfruit**
Carambolas. Five sided fruits which taste similar to grapes
**Mangosteen**
Leathery purple skin with amazing sweet fruit inside. Easy to open.

---

**Coconut**
Due to the lack of tropical beaches, it is harvested around the many oasis's in the Surus desert.

Cauliflower, Lentil, Corn

## Meats
**Neck Meat/Neck Tail**
Meat from Necks, small lizards. Due to its size the tail contains the most meat. Its tail can be easily grilled above a fire, because the scales protect and conduct heat.

## Spices
**Grated Earthmelon**
Grated earthmelon insides. Makes dishes sweeter
**Dried [[bellfruit|Bellfruit]] peels**
Tastes similar to cinnamon, yet can be harvested everywhere.

Cloves (Kruidnagel), Mint
